    GPT_Generated_Description = "Leans back slightly on her left arm while sitting at the edge of a pool, with her left leg bent and right leg extended out of frame. Holds a clear plastic cup filled with a bright blue drink in her right hand, sipping through a white straw. Tilts her head subtly to the right, giving a soft, composed expression. Gazes downward and to her left, avoiding eye contact with the camera or viewer. Slightly parts her lips around the straw as she drinks. Wears a two-piece outfit that includes a halter top and high-waisted bottom with a decorative element on the waistband. Keeps her posture relaxed, creating a casual and effortless vibe. Appears to be illuminated by warm, natural sunlight, enhancing the poolside atmosphere."
