prompt = f"""Have this person be in the empty background while matching her face and body to the bolded outline and wearing the clothes given from the reference image. She should be {GPT_Generated_Description}, Absolutely do not change hairstyle, especially if long. Absolutely do not change background. There should be none of the bolded outline remaining; remove all of the bolded outline (be especially careful at the corner's of the image)"""

